    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Prime 1.58 Acre Holding (0.64 Hectares)\n\nAn Exceptional Opportunity to Acquire a Prime Parcel of Land in a Highly Convenient Location Close to Gorey Town\n\nKinsella Estates Gorey are delighted to offer this prime parcel of land extending to approximately 1.58 acres (0.64 hectares) at Creagh Upper, Gorey, Co. Wexford to the market.\n\nOccupying an excellent location just 1.2 km from Gorey Town, along the Hollyfort Road, the property represents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial holding within exceptionally close proximity to the town and its extensive range of amenities.\n\nThe lands are contained within Folio WX28110F and benefit from a highly accessible location with convenient access to Gorey and the surrounding road network.\n\nGiven the property's size and strategic location close to Gorey Town, the holding may offer interesting long-term potential, subject entirely to the necessary planning permission, zoning requirements and all relevant statutory approvals.\n\nProspective purchasers are advised to satisfy themselves independently regarding the planning status and any potential future use or development of the property.\n\nThis is an attractive opportunity for purchasers seeking a well-located landholding close to one of North Wexford's most thriving towns, whether for investment, agricultural or potential longer-term purposes.\n\n\nPROPERTY DETAILS\n\nLand Area: Approximately 1.58 Acres (0.64 Hectares)\nFolio: WX28110F\nTitle: Freehold\nServices: Water Well\nPrice Region: 350,000\n\n\nPlease note: Map attached is for identification purposes only.\n\nDirections: From Gorey, proceed out the Hollyfort Road for approximately 1.2 km. The lands are located on the left-hand side.\n\n\n"
      },
